@startuml
!theme materia
title RTP Status Update Flow (sync) — POST /rtps/status-update
actor "**Client**" as CLIENT
participant "**MS-SENDER**\n(rtp-sender-v2)" as SENDER
database "**RTPS**\n(MongoDB)" as MONGO
database "**Service Registry**\n(Azure Blob Storage)" as SR
participant "**OAuth2 Provider**" as OAUTH
participant "**Sidecar**\n(sidecar-epc-proxy)" as SIDECAR
participant "**EPC SP**" as EPC
database "**Azure Data Explorer**\n(SRTP)" as ADX
autonumber "<b>[0]"

CLIENT -> SENDER: **POST** /rtps/status-update \n(bodyRequest: resourceId)
activate SENDER

SENDER -> MONGO: find Rtp by resourceId
activate MONGO

alt **RTP Found**
  MONGO --> SENDER: Rtp
  deactivate MONGO

  SENDER -> SR: retrieve service provider data
  activate SR

  alt **SP Found**
    SR --> SENDER: SP data
    deactivate SR

    opt **[OAUTH2] oauth2 field present in TSP config**
      SENDER -> OAUTH: request OAuth2 token
      activate OAUTH
      OAUTH --> SENDER: access token
      deactivate OAUTH
    end

    loop **retry up to 3 times (backoff) only if Sidecar is unreachable**
      SENDER -> SIDECAR: **POST** /proxy/v1/status-update/{resourceId}
      activate SIDECAR
    end

    SIDECAR -> EPC: POST /sepa-request-to-pay-requests/{id}/status-update
    activate EPC

    alt **[200 OK] Success Cases**
      alt **200 with reason ALAC**
        EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (Rsn: ALAC)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200 (reasonCode: ALAC)
        deactivate SIDECAR
        SENDER -> MONGO: triggerUserAcceptRtp → **state**: **USER_ACCEPTED**
        activate MONGO
        MONGO --> SENDER: updated
        deactivate MONGO
        note right of SENDER: SENT | ACCEPTED → USER_ACCEPTED

      else **[SUCCESS — FINAL] 200 with reason AEXR / ARFR / ARJR**
        EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (Rsn: AEXR | ARFR | ARJR)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200 (reasonCode)
        deactivate SIDECAR
        note right of SENDER
          AEXR → **EXPIRED** (from SENT | ACCEPTED)
          ARFR → **USER_REJECTED** (from SENT | ACCEPTED)
          ARJR → **REJECTED** (from SENT)
        end note

        loop **retry on error (exhausted → error propagated)**
          SENDER -> ADX: save RTP record (final **state**) + RTP events
          activate ADX
          ADX --> SENDER: confirm
          deactivate ADX
        end

        loop **retry on error (exhausted → error propagated)**
          SENDER -> MONGO: delete RTP record
          activate MONGO
          MONGO --> SENDER: confirm delete
          deactivate MONGO
        end

      else **[SUCCESS — ERROR_SEND] 200 with reason IRNR**
        EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (Rsn: IRNR)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200 (reasonCode: IRNR)
        deactivate SIDECAR
        note right of SENDER: CREATED | SENT | ACCEPTED → **ERROR_SEND** (no ADX)

        loop **retry on error (exhausted → error propagated)**
          SENDER -> MONGO: delete RTP record
          activate MONGO
          MONGO --> SENDER: confirm delete
          deactivate MONGO
        end

      else **[NO TRANSITION] 200 with reason REPR / RSPR, or no reason**
        EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (REPR | RSPR | no reason)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200
        deactivate SIDECAR
        note right of SENDER
          State unchanged, nothing written to the DB.
          No reason → outcome comes later through the async callback
        end note

      else **[ALREADY APPLIED] RTP already in the state implied by the reason**
        EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (reasonCode)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200 (reasonCode)
        deactivate SIDECAR
        note right of SENDER: idempotent no-op, nothing written to the DB
      end

      SENDER --> CLIENT: **200 OK** (resourceId, reason)
      note right of SENDER
        **200 OK Cases:**
        - Reason ALAC (USER_ACCEPTED)
        - Reason AEXR / ARFR / ARJR (Final states saved to ADX & deleted from MONGO)
        - Reason IRNR (ERROR_SEND & deleted from MONGO)
        - Reason REPR / RSPR or no reason (No transition / async callback)
        - Already applied (Idempotent no-op)
      end note

    else **[422 Unprocessable Entity] Client Error Cases**
      alt **[STATE CONFLICT] transition not allowed from current state**
        EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (reasonCode)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200 (reasonCode)
        deactivate SIDECAR
      else **[UNKNOWN REASON] unrecognised reason code**
        EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (unknown Rsn)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 200 (unknown reasonCode)
        deactivate SIDECAR
      else **[NON-CONFORMANT] 4xx — missing StsRsnInf.Rsn / empty or unreadable body**
        EPC --[#red]> SIDECAR: non-conformant response
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 4xx
        deactivate SIDECAR
      else **[REJECTED by SP] 4xx**
        EPC --[#red]> SIDECAR: 4xx (errorBody)
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 4xx (error body)
        deactivate SIDECAR
      end

      SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **422 Unprocessable Entity**
      note right of SENDER
        **422 Cases:**
        - Invalid status transition
        - Service Provider invalid response (Unknown reason / Non-conformant 4xx)
        - Service Provider rejection
      end note

    else **[500 Internal Server Error] Server Error Cases**
      alt **[SERVER ERROR] 5xx / Sidecar unreachable / Timeout**
        EPC --[#red]> SIDECAR: 5xx
        deactivate EPC
        SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 5xx / timeout
        deactivate SIDECAR
      end

      SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **500 Internal Server Error**
      note right of SENDER
        **500 Cases:**
        - Service Provider 5xx error
        - Sidecar unreachable after retries / read timeout
      end note
    end

  else **[SP NOT FOUND] Provider not in registry**
    SR --[#red]> SENDER: not found
    deactivate SR
    SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **500 Internal Server Error**
    note right of SENDER: Provider not found in Service Registry
  end

else **[NOT FOUND] RTP not in DB**
  MONGO --[#red]> SENDER: empty
  deactivate MONGO
  SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **404 Not Found**

else **[INVALID REQUEST] Malformed request**
  SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **400 Bad Request**
  deactivate SENDER
end
@enduml